-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；句子子域见 [[57-df-sentence]]。单公式赋值满足与赋值集合见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]、[[57-df-assignment]]。不带赋值的开放公式采用所有赋值下成立的约定，句子上的原接口不变。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1076,"backlinks":[{"id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"见 [[57-df-model]] 中 $\\models$ 的定义"},{"id":"f985ced977f087d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7ed93be444b87576","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e551d27957ab42ad","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 保持 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的字母表集合约定，不是 88 的签名元组；$|S|$ 因而是该字母表的基数。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，模型与结构见 [[57-df-sentence]]、[[57-df-model]]、[[57-df-structure]]。假定 $\\Phi$ 有无限模型，即 $\\exists\\mathfrak M\\,(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak M,S)\\land\\mathfrak M\\models\\Phi\\land\\aleph_0\\leq||\\mathfrak M||)$。$\\kappa$ 是 [[57-df-cardinal]] 的基数；$||\\mathfrak A||$ 缩写论域集合 $|\\mathfrak A|$ 的基数。"},{"id":"2e3d328f04769ef7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，见 [[57-df-sentence]]。假定 $\\Phi$ 存在无限模型；模型、论域与基数见 [[57-df-model]]、[[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-cardinal]]。$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$ 且 $\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\k